@startuml
title UX 2.1 DEV: word-game context and readable article publication
actor Learner
participant "Web" as Web
participant "GotIt Backend" as Backend
database "Product DB" as DB
Learner -> Web: Choose words and game
Web -> Web: Retain bounded internal return context
Web -> Backend: POST practice/sessions (same creation intent on retry)
Backend -> DB: Scope, select and snapshot items
Backend --> Web: Session
Web -> Backend: POST session/exercises
Backend --> Web: Exercises with private answer omitted
opt Typed exercise
  Web -> Backend: GET session/study
  Backend --> Web: Existing study cards
  Web -> Web: Retain language pair only; show full alphabet
end
Learner -> Web: Click letters or type using keyboard/IME
Web -> Backend: POST practice/attempts (stable intent)
Backend -> DB: Atomic attempt and authoritative learning/XP updates
Backend --> Web: Receipt
Learner -> Web: Finish
Web --> Learner: Summary and same originating context
Learner -> Web: Generate reading
Web -> Backend: POST reading/preview
Backend --> Web: Generated text and publicationToken
Web --> Learner: Readable text immediately
Web -> Backend: POST reading (publicationToken, Idempotency-Key)
alt Published
  Backend -> DB: Idempotent publication
  Backend --> Web: Saved reading
  Web --> Learner: Saved reader and quiz entry
else Technical failure
  Backend --> Web: Error or ambiguous timeout
  Web --> Learner: Keep the same text; offer retry
  Learner -> Web: Retry publication
  Web -> Backend: Same publicationToken, payload and Idempotency-Key
end
note over Web,DB
Local fixture verification does not authorize DEV writes.
Release waits for DEV Backend database isolation.
end note
@enduml
